        "id": 5,
        "policy": "Income - BFS (Other BFS Programs, Bank Statement etc)",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] Designed for self-employed borrowers who are not able to qualify under traditional debt servicing and/or credit guidelines, and has 6 or 12 months Bank statements as proof of owning and operating a business.\r\n**Loan Purpose:** \r\n- Purchase, Refinance, Equity take-out \r\n**Loan Amount:** \r\n- Minimum: $200,000 \r\n- Maximum: $3,000,000* \r\n**Maximum LTV:** \r\n- Urban Markets: 80%** \r\n- Rest of Canada: 75% \r\n**Amortization:** \r\n- up to 40 year AM \r\n**Property Type:** \r\n- Single Family Dwelling \r\n- Condos \r\n- Townhouses \r\n**Credit Requirement:** \r\n- BFS/Bank Statement Qualifying: Minimum 600\r\n**Income:** \r\n- BFS/Bank Statements are permitted \r\n- 6 or 12 month bank statement option is available \r\n- Commissioned F/T and P/T incomes may be acceptable \r\n- Business Registration/Articles of Incorporation: min. of 2 years \r\n- 2 years T4A/Commission Statements (if applicable) \r\n**Downpayment:** \r\n* 5% from own resources\r\n* Gifted funds allowed after that\r\n* Borrowed funds allowed if debt-serviced\r\n**Appraisal:** \r\n- Full appraisal required for all transactions*** \r\n- Must be selected from Aspire\u2019s approved appraiser list. \r\n**Note:** \r\nOther territories and provinces may be considered, please contact your Aspire BDM. \r\n**Lending Areas:** \r\n- All provinces except Quebec \r\n\\* For any loans exceeding $2mm, contact your Aspire BDM. \r\n\\** LTV includes Strive\u2019s commitment fee \r\n\\*** Strive reserves the right to request a second appraisal in certain instances. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, Ontario, Saskatchewan)",
