        "id": 71,
        "policy": "Property Type",
        "description": "**Eligible Properties**\r\n* To qualify for mortgage consideration by B2B Bank, a property must meet several conditions:\r\n* Year-Round Accessibility & Livability:\r\n* Accessible via public or private road at all times.\r\n* Livable throughout the year and located near services.\r\n**Structural & Regulatory Compliance:**\r\n* Built on proper foundations: concrete slab, blocks, or stone and mortar.\r\n* Meets building code, zoning, and environmental regulations.\r\n* In good condition and a sound mortgage pledge.\r\n**Remaining Economic Life:**\r\n* Must be equal to or greater than the requested amortization period.\r\n**Environmental Safety:**\r\n* Must be free from harmful substances (e.g., pyrite, radon), or within acceptable thresholds.\r\n**Ineligible Properties B2B Bank will not finance the following types of properties:**\r\n**Non-Traditional / High-Risk Usage**\r\n* Airbnb rentals\r\n* Bed & Breakfasts\r\n* Flips\r\n* Rooming houses\r\n* Elder care homes\r\n* Cannabis grow ops / meth labs\r\n* High-crime or high-risk socio-economic areas\r\n**Structurally or Legally Restricted**\r\n* Properties with:\r\n* Insulbrick siding or John Mansfield Siding\r\n* Pillar foundation mobile homes\r\n* No access to public services like electricity\r\n* Life lease or co-op ownership\r\n**Condominium types:**\r\n* Owned by a syndicate\r\n* Undivided co-ownership\r\n* High maintenance fees\r\n* Underfunded reserve funds\r\n* Converted with protected tenants\r\n* Condo hotels, timeshares, or fractional ownership\r\n**Zoning and Location Restrictions**\r\n* Industrial properties\r\n* Properties in commercial zones (exceptions case-by-case)\r\n* Homes on military bases or First Nations reserves\r\n* Mixed-use with >20% business use\r\n* Properties on or near hazardous sites or leased land (unless program-approved)\r\n**Operational Restrictions**\r\n* Solar-powered only\r\n* Properties with unacceptable business activities, including:\r\n* Food production, manufacturing, industrial use\r\n* Hazardous materials\r\n* Unusual business hours (Applies: National)",
