        "description": "**Eligible Properties**: \r\n - Legal rental units only. \r\n - Properties can be fully rented or owner-occupied with a legal suite. \r\n**Ineligible Properties**: \r\n - Student rentals \r\n - Time-share properties, condo hotels, short-term rentals. \r\n**Notes**: \r\n - Rate premiums may apply to rental mortgages. \r\n - Pre-payment privileges: \r\n - Increase payments by up to 15% once per calendar year. \r\n - Prepay up to 15% of the original principal per year (Applies: National)",
