        "id": 58,
        "policy": "Pre Payment Options",
        "description": "**Gateway Alternative Mortgage Program**\r\n* Up to 20% of the original loan amount with a minimum of $500 can be paid on the anniversary date of the mortgage. Unfortunately any unused amounts cannot be carried forward (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
