        "id": 65,
        "policy": "Refinance & Renewal",
        "description": "**Gateway Alternative Mortgage Program**\r\n* This programs is designed for refinances up to 80% LTV\r\n**Special Note re Apartment Style Condos (GTA or GVA)**\r\n**Owner-occupied:**\r\n* LTV <75%\r\n* GDS/TDS 55/55,\r\n*550 Beacon\r\n* up to 35-year amortization\r\n**Owner Occupied**\r\n* LTV =<80%\r\n* GDS/TDS 50/50\r\n* 640 Beacon\r\n* up to 30-year amortization\r\n**Rental:**\r\n* LTV <70%\r\n* GDS/TDS 55/55,\r\n* 550 Beacon\r\n* up to 35-year amortization\r\n**Rental**\r\n* LTV =<75%\r\n* GDS/TDS 50/50,\r\n* 640 Beacon\r\n* up to 30-year amortization (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
