        "policy": "Terms",
        "description": "* Aveo Traditional - Fixed 1, 2 and 3 year closed\r\n* Aveo Flex40 \u2013 Fixed 1, and 2 year terms, open after 6 months from funding date (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, Ontario, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
