        "id": 93,
        "policy": "Value Added Products",
        "description": "We are pleased to share that Coast Capital's New Member Offers are back and available from August 18 to November 30.\r\nThese offers provide an excellent opportunity to deliver additional value to your clients who are new to Coast Capital, helping them make the most of their banking relationship beyond their mortgage financing.\r\nRetail New Member Offer New Coast Capital personal members can receive up to $600 when they open and use a qualifying chequing account and credit card.\r\nBusiness New Member Offer New Coast Capital business members can receive up to $600 when they open and use a qualifying business chequing account and credit card.\r\nPlease note that these offers are intended as an added value for your clients and no commission is paid to brokers in connection with these promotions. (Applies: British Columbia)",
