        "description": "* 50% of condo fees are used for debt servicing.\r\n* 3% repayment is used on all trades unless a payment is otherwise noted on the credit bureau.\r\n* Up to 50% GDS / 50% TDS is available for salaried borrowers with a 550+ credit score (\u201cHigh Amber\u201d or better).\r\n* Extended Ratio Program (ERP) is available for eligible owner-occupied purchases and refinances.\r\n* Eligible owner-occupied borrowers can qualify up to 55% TDS.\r\n* ERP is available to 100% salaried and majority-salaried borrowers. BFS income is no longer required to make up at least 50% of qualifying income.\r\n* Minimum 640 FICO is required for ERP deals up to 75% LTV.\r\n* Borrowers with a 680+ FICO can qualify for ERP financing up to 80% LTV.\r\n* No ERP rate premium applies.\r\n* Extended ratios up to 60% GDS / 60% TDS are available for owner-occupied and rental properties.\r\n* No rate premium applies for extended ratios. (Applies: National)",
