        "description": "* Title Insurance is required (optional in Quebec except for private purchases)\r\n* will accept title insurance from any company providing a certificate of insurance prior to funding\r\n* [Link to FCT](https://www.fct.ca/customers/mortgage-broker/res-title-insurance/platinum-service.aspx). (Applies: National)",
