        "description": "[ACCEPTED] 100% of the employment income can be used\r\nHere is what is required:\r\n- A current letter of employment is required confirming the borrower is currently on maternity/parental leave. The letter must include the borrowers return to work date, position and salary (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
