        "description": "**Debt-servicing (Excalibur)**\r\n**Payment calculation by liability type**\r\n**Installment loans**\r\n* Use payment shown on the credit report (use 5% of balance if no payment is reported).\r\n* If \u2264 6 contractual payments remain, you may exclude the payment from TDS.\r\n* Car leases must be included regardless of remaining term\r\n**Government of Canada Student Loan**\r\n* Use payment shown on the credit report (use 2% of balance if no payment is reported).\r\n**Student Line of Credit**\r\n* Use payment shown on the credit report (use 2% of balance if no payment is reported).\r\n**Revolving credit**\r\n* Use 3% of outstanding balance.\r\n**Secured line of credit**\r\n* Calculate payment using account balance at the 5-year benchmark rate amortized over 25 years.\r\n* You may use the contract rate instead of the 5-year benchmark rate with written confirmation of the contract rate (retain proof on file).\r\n* Program note: Will consider clients who have a CEBA loan\r\n**Ratio & program notes**\r\n* Max ratios up to 80% LTV: GDS/TDS 50/50%.\r\n* Max ratios under 65% LTV: GDS/TDS 55/55%. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
