        "policy": "Leased land",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] * Permitted Insured/Insurable \u2013 Government and Private leaseholds acceptable subject to:\r\n* The term of the lease must be at least 5 years longer than the mortgage amortization period\r\n* Head and sub lease required\r\n* Lease must be fixed for the term\r\n* Leasehold interest must be assignable to mortgagee/insurer in the event of default\r\n* Lease must be converted to freehold, in the even of default and legal action\r\n* 1 and 2 unit properties on fixed foundation only\r\n* Manual review by the insurer is required NOTE: mobile/modular homes on leasehold/chattel loan insured program (CLIP) transactions not eligible (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Ontario)",
