        "policy": "Switch Transfer - General Information Collateral Charge",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Loan Amount**\r\n* Minimum $100,000, all products\r\n* If a Collateral charge, minimum $250,000.\r\n**Property Type**\r\n* Owner occupied: 1-4 units\r\n* Second Homes: 1 unit only\r\n* Rental available on High Ratio transfers only, insurable 2-4 units\r\n**Amortization**\r\n* Standard: Amortization cannot exceed the remaining\r\n* Collateral: Amortization can be extended back to 25 years (insurable). If an insured transfer, the lesser of the remaining amortization OR 25 years applies.\r\n* Insurable deals only: For deals with two or more charges (from the same lender), being transferred into a new first charge, the amortization is not to exceed the lesser of the amortizations where multiples exist.\r\n**Qualifying Rate**\r\n* Must qualify based on the greater of the contract rate plus (+) 2% or the Bank of Canada 5 year benchmark rate\r\n* Qualification under the contract rate may be eligible subject to grandfathered eligibility guidelines where we are transferring existing insurance.\r\n**Eligible Changes**\r\n* Standard: Not eligible for covenant changes\r\n* Collateral: Addition OR removal of a legal spouse or common-law NOT because of a marital separation/divorce. As well as a child, parent, sibling or grandparent/grandchild.\" (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Ontario)",
