        "policy": "Reverse Mortgage",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Program Overview**\r\n* The EquityAccess Reverse Mortgage from Home Trust is designed to help homeowners aged 55 and over unlock the equity in their homes to achieve financial goals or secure their future \u2014 without needing to sell their property or make regular payments.\r\n* Funds received are tax-free and require no monthly repayments; repayment occurs only when the home is sold, permanently vacated, or upon the borrower\u2019s death\r\n**Product options**\r\n* EquityAccess \u2013 Single lump-sum advance (minimum $25,000).\r\n* EquityAccess+ \u2013 Combination of lump-sum and scheduled or ad hoc advances.\r\n* EquityAccess Boost \u2013 For ages 70+, offers higher loan-to-value (LTV) limits\r\n**Eligibility & Limits Age:**\r\n* 55 (70 for Boost)\r\n* Property Type: Owner-occupied\r\n* Minimum Home Value: $250,000\r\n* No minimum FICO\u00ae score required\r\n* Maximum Loan-to-Value (LTV):\r\n* EquityAccess: up to 40%\r\n* EquityAccess+: up to 55%\r\n* Boost: up to 59%\r\n**Area**\r\n* In ON, BC, NS and AB (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Quebec)",
        "isAccepted": null
