        "policy": "Rentals - Amortization, LTV, Debt Servicing & Gifted Down Payment",
        "description": "**Alternative Mortgage Rental**\r\n**Amortization** \r\n* 30 years,\r\n**LTV**\r\n* Up to 80%\r\n**Debt Servicing**\r\n* Flexible \r\n**Gifted Down Payment**\r\n* Gifted down payment is allowed\r\n**Accelerator. Mortgage Rental**\r\n**Amortization**\r\n* Minimum: 5 years\r\n* Maximum: 25 years\r\n**Loan-to-Value (LTV)**\r\n* Maximum LTV: 80%\r\n* Minimum Loan Amount: $150,000\r\n* Maximum Loan Amount: $800,000\r\n**Debt Servicing Ratios (GDS/TDS)**\r\n* Maximum GDS (Gross Debt Service): 39%\r\n* Maximum TDS (Total Debt Service): 44%\r\n**Gifted Down**\r\n* Not permitted (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Quebec)",
