        "policy": "Rentals - Documentation",
        "description": "**Documentation Required for Alternative Program**\r\n* Confirmed using either: Tenant acknowledgement or most recent T1 generals with declared rents or lease/rental agreement or copies of 6 months bank statement confirming deposits or fair market rents from an appraisal or an approved source recognized by HTC (designated HTC appraisers, HTC site inspectors and registered real estate agents who are acting as a 3rd party and have no interest in the real estate transaction)\r\n**Documentation Required for Accelerator Program**\r\n* Rental income must be documented and verifiable through one of the following:\r\n* A signed lease agreement for the property; or\r\n* An appraisal report that includes a market rent estimate supported by comparable rentals.\r\n* These documents confirm that the rental income figure used for qualification is realistic and market-supported. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Quebec)",
