        "id": 71,
        "policy": "Submission Tips & Underwriting Assistance",
        "description": "* 24-48 hours for response times on submissions\r\n* Purchase or refinance. If refinance, what is the purpose of the funds?\r\n* Explanations on major credit events or late payments, if any\r\n* Is the income verifiable or stated? How long have they been at their jobs or business? How did you arrive at the income amount? Job letter and latest paystub, or using a 2-year average, or bank statements? Any rental income used? How did you calculate it, and what supporting documents will we have?\r\n* What loan to value do you require?\r\n* Minimum Beacon score(s) 600\r\n* Outline all relevant sources and their corresponding amounts for Down Payment\r\n* Confirmation the property is in an urban center/not rural? Is the property OO or rental? What is the type of property? SFD, condo, townhome?\r\n* Do not accept TransUnion\r\n**Notes for BFS deal**\r\n- Be sure to include the following in your notes:\r\n- Type of business\r\n- Number of employees\r\n- Years in business\r\n- Number of owners\r\n- Net income and expense calculation (see below)\r\n_For the income it is important to SHOW YOUR MATH._\r\n_Use the net income from below as qualifying income._\r\n***Be sure to include the following in your notes:***\r\n- Gross revenue/deposits\r\n_minus_\r\n- Cost of goods\r\n- Salaries/wages\r\n- Rent\r\n- Advertising\r\n- Phone/internet/utilities\r\n- Vehicle expenses\r\n- Any other ongoing business expenses\r\n**Notes to Include re Stated Income**\r\n* Basics of the business\r\n* Industry\r\n* Structure \u2013 sole proprietor vs. corporation?\r\n* Tenure \u2013 how long has this business been in operation?\r\n* Ownership\r\n* What % ownership do the borrowers have in this business?\r\n* Income/Expenses\r\n* What is the income amount?\r\n* What are common monthly expenses?\r\n* Does the income come in via personal or business bank statements?\r\n* In the bank statements, are there are any one-off expenses? If so, please make sure to articulate what those are\r\n* Do the customers have receipts/invoices to confirm some of the recent deposits?\r\n* Misc.\r\n* Are their personal taxes paid to date?\r\n**SignUp**\r\n- Need agents to submit under an active account holder. We allow individual agents along with broker-owners to open an account, there is an agreement involved to have access. \r\n- All submissions need to be submitted through an active MERIX Financial broker. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Ontario)",
