        "policy": "Square Footage",
        "description": "* Single Family Dwelling 800 Sq Feet \r\n* Semi-Detached 800 Sq Feet. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
