        "policy": "Switch Transfer - General Information Collateral Charge",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Purpose:** Straight & Collateral Transfers\r\n**Property Type** \r\n- Owner-occupied, maximum 4 units\r\n- Second home\r\n- No mobile homes\r\n**Terms:** \r\n- Straight Transfer:\r\n - Fixed Rate Mortgage, 1-5 years\r\n - Adjustable Rate Mortgage (ARM), 5-years\r\n- Collateral Transfer:\r\n - Fixed Rate Mortgage, 1-5 years\r\n - Adjustable Rate Mortgage (ARM), 5 years\r\n**Loan Amount**\r\n- Minimum $100,000\r\n- Maximum $999,000\r\n**Debt Servicing**\r\n- GDS maximum 39%\r\n- TDS maximum 44%\r\n**Qualifying Rate**\r\n- Must qualify based on the greater of the contract rate (+) 2% or the Bank of Canada 5-year benchmark rate\r\n- Transactionally insured transfers are exempt from the Mortgage Qualifying rate (MQR)\r\n**Maximum Loan To-Value (LTV)**\r\n- Max \u2264 95%\r\n**Amortization**\r\n- Insurable Loans\r\n - Minimum 15 years\r\n - Maximum 25 years\r\n- Remaining amortization is not to exceed the original amortization minus the time elapsed since the original mortgage was registered\r\n**Beacon Requirements**\r\n- Minimum 680 for each applicant\r\n**Additional Documentation**\r\n- Request for Statement & Authorization Form\r\n- Current Renewal Agreement or Mortgage Statement, a copy of Property Tax Assessment, and Fire Insurance particulars\r\n**Closing Process**\r\n- All deals will be closed by FCT\r\n**Appraisals**\r\n- If applicable, must be ordered through RPS (Brookfield), Solidifi, or NAS\r\n**Other**\r\n- Transfers accepted from Canadian Prime Lenders only\r\n- No Private Mortgages\r\n- No New to Canada\r\n- No Pre-Approvals\r\n- No Stated Income. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
