        "description": "**INSURED**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score:\r\n* 650 required for all applicants on purchase transactions\r\n* Notes:\r\n*Applies to Insured High Ratio, Medical, Frontline, and New to Canada programs\r\n* Some stated income (e.g. BFS) requires at least one borrower with 680 if LTV is \u2264 80%\r\n**INSURABLE**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score:\r\n* 650 required for all applicants\r\n* Rate Adjustment:\r\n* If the primary applicant\u2019s beacon score is less than 680, add 20 bps to the interest rate\r\n* Notes:\r\n* Applies to Low Ratio Insured, Transfers (Insurable), and other insurable standard programs\r\n**UNINSURABLE \u2013 Purchases & Transfers**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score:\r\n* 650 required for all applicants\r\n* Notes:\r\n* Applies to Uninsurable Owner Occupied, Second Home, and Rental programs\r\n* Applies to both standard purchases and transfer deals\r\n**UNINSURABLE \u2013 Refinance**\r\n* Owner-Occupied Refinance:\r\n* Primary applicant must have minimum 680\r\n* Secondary/co-borrowers must have minimum 650\r\n* Rental Refinance:\r\n* Primary applicant must have minimum 700\r\n* Secondary/co-borrowers must have minimum 650\r\n* Notes:\r\n* These stricter thresholds apply only at refinance stage under uninsurable programs. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
