        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Please take special note: This is ONLY available if you have President's Club or Partner's Club Status. You will not be able to access this option without status.** \r\n**Rate is 5-year fixed and 5-year variable terms 10 bps higher above our lowest published rate (rentals). Speak to your BRM for details.** \r\n#### **Non-Personal Mortgages Key Features** \r\n- This type of mortgage is used to facilitate the registration of a residential mortgage in a company name. \r\n- Uninsured applications from Holding Companies (Hold Cos) may be considered for non-STEP mortgages; mortgage default insurance is not available. \r\n#### **Product Features & Details** \r\n##### **Borrower Qualification** \r\n- Only one company name is permitted as borrower; companies that are owned wholly or in part by another company are not eligible. \r\n- All individuals who are owners/principals of the borrowing company must provide personal guarantees for the loan. \r\n- Non-owners cannot be applicants. \r\n- The Hold Co\u2019s transaction and business dealings must be limited solely to activities within Canada. \r\n##### **Eligible Loan Purposes** \r\n- Purchase \r\n- Refinance \r\n##### **Maximum Loan to Value Ratio** \r\n- Up to 80% LTV \r\n##### **Scotia Total Equity\u00ae Plan (Scotia STEP\u00ae Program)** \r\n- Not available \r\n##### **Amortization** \r\n- Maximum 30 years \r\n##### **Down Payment** \r\n- Standard requirements apply \r\n##### **Payment Frequencies** \r\n- Any day monthly (except the 29th, 30th, or 31st), bi-weekly, and weekly \r\n##### **Title Registration** \r\n- Must be registered in the company name \r\n##### **Document Requirements** \r\n- Articles of Incorporation \r\n- Banking Resolution \r\n**In submission comments, leave notes to confirm the following:** \r\n- The Hold Co\u2019s legal and/or trading name \r\n- That all current owners of the Hold Co are the applicants on the non-personal mortgage \r\n##### **Income Verification** \r\n- Standard income verification requirements apply \r\n- Capacity (GDSR and TDSR) is based on all the owners/principals of the company. \r\n- Rental income may be used for qualification. \r\n##### **Exclusions** \r\n- Pre-approvals \r\n- Operating companies \r\n- Long and short mortgage \r\n- Mortgages under any other specialty program: \r\n - Manufactured and modular homes \r\n - Mobile homes \r\n - Projected Income: Dentists & Vets \r\n - Projected Income: Physicians \r\n - Renovation Financing \r\n### **Note** \r\n- Can combine this with the Total Net Worth or Business for Self Plus Program with rate premiums applied (Applies: National)",
