        "policy": "Switch Transfer - General Information Standard Charge",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] ### Switch to Scotiabank Program\r\n* The program allows the transfer of an existing acceptable **conventional mortgage** from another lender to Scotiabank, with **no change to the borrowers on title**.\r\n* Eligible transactions are **switches only, with no additional funds**.\r\n* Maximum loan-to-value is **up to 95% LTV**.\r\n* The new mortgage will match the client's **current remaining amortization period**:\r\n * Insured: up to 25 years\r\n * Uninsured: up to 30 years\r\n* A straight switch into the **Scotia Total Equity\u00ae Plan (STEP\u00ae Program) is not available**.\r\n* **Collateral mortgages are not eligible** for the Switch Program. For collateral charges, speak with your Broker Onboarding Officer or Broker Relationship Manager about refinance options.\r\n* For **uninsured mortgages**, existing lender fees, including prepayment charges, may be capitalized:\r\n * Up to $8,000 where LTV does not exceed 70%.\r\n * Where LTV is greater than 70%, fees may be capitalized up to a maximum of 80% LTV.\r\n* For **insured mortgages**, up to $3,000 may be capitalized to cover existing lender fees, including prepayment charges.\r\n* **Default insurer re-approval is not required.**\r\n* Scotiabank will cover up to a maximum of **$400 toward the existing lender's discharge or assignment/transfer fee**, excluding prepayment charges. This fee coverage is **not applicable in Quebec**.\r\n* **Preapprovals are not eligible.** Other exclusions include:\r\n * Collateral mortgages\r\n * Lines of credit\r\n * Private mortgages\r\n * Second mortgages\r\n * Purchase Plus Improvements\r\n * Leased land properties\r\n * Mobile homes\r\n * Scotia STEP\u00ae Program\r\n * Projected Income: Dentists and Veterinarians\r\n* Standard borrower qualifications and debt servicing ratios apply.\r\n* All applications are subject to Scotiabank's credit criteria, residential mortgage standards and, where applicable, mortgage insurers' lending criteria. Program features and requirements are subject to change. (Applies: National)",
