        "policy": "Amortization",
        "description": "**30 Years**\r\n* conventional\r\n**25 Years**\r\n* Insured\r\nScotiabank offers extended amortization options for eligible ***First-Time Home Buyers (FTHBs)***. Default-insured applications can now include amortization periods of up to 30 years, subject to specific conditions:\r\n1. Borrowers must meet the Federal Government's FTHB definition or purchase a newly constructed, unoccupied property.\r\n2. The property must be owner-occupied (primary or secondary residence).\r\n3. Loan-to-Value (LTV) ratio must exceed 80% and include default insurance from CMHC, Sagen, or CG.\r\nSome restrictions apply, including leasehold properties or programs with LTV caps under 80% (Applies: National)",
