        "description": "**Amortization**\r\n* Up to 30 years\r\n**Maximum Loan to Value Ratio**\r\n* Up to 65% if ScotiaLine\u00ae with access card (1st mortgages only)\r\n* Up to 80% LTV\r\n**GDS/TDS**\r\n* Consult your underwriter\r\n**Gifted Down Payment**\r\n* Gifted down payments are not acceptable toward the minimum 20% down payment\r\n**Downpayment**\r\n* Minimum 20% must be from client's own resources. Gifted down payments and secondary financing are only acceptable in excess of the minimum 20% down payment. (Applies: National)",
