        "id": 93,
        "policy": "Types of Financing",
        "description": "* Owner Occupied Purchase and Refinance \r\n* HELOC \r\n* Open Mortgages \r\n* Speciality Programs\r\n* Rentals\r\n* See other categories for details\r\n* first-time home buyers (FTHBs) purchasing new construction homes (Applies: National)",
        "isAccepted": null
