        "policy": "Mobiles & Modulars",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Eligible: Modular/Manufactured Homes (Single Advance Only)**\r\n* Conventional Financing Criteria:\r\n* TD will consider modular/manufactured homes for single advance financing only (no progress/draw construction).\r\n* Must meet all standard property guidelines, including:\r\n* Owner-occupied\r\n* Proper foundation (i.e., permanent and acceptable to insurer/appraiser)\r\n* Full municipal services (or acceptable alternatives)\r\n* Recognized residential location\r\n* Land must be owned, not leased\r\n* Property must be 100% complete at the time of advance\r\n* Other Requirements:\r\n* Appraisal and marketability assessment may be required\r\n* No special programs apply\u2014must qualify under regular conventional underwriting\r\n**TD does not finance the following in the broker channel**\r\n* Mobile homes\r\n* Floating homes\r\n* CLIP Program (Canadian Lending Initiative for Prefabricated housing) or similar modular home financing programs\r\n* These properties are considered non-standard or high-risk, and are excluded from TD\u2019s acceptable property types for mortgage lending (Applies: National)",
