        "description": "**TD Minimum Beacon Score Requirements**\r\n* General (Conventional & Insured Mortgages)\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score: 650.\r\n**Business for Self (BFS)**\r\n* Insured WITHOUT Traditional Income Confirmation\r\n(Only eligible through Sagen and Canada Guaranty)\r\nLTV Minimum Credit Score\r\n* Greater than 80% LTV 650\r\n* 80% LTV or less 680\r\n* Additional Requirements:\r\n* Minimum 2 years credit history\r\n* At least 2 trade lines\r\n**With Traditional Income Confirmation (Conventional & Insured)**\r\n* Gross-Up Max LTV Min Credit Score Notes\r\n* \u2264 20% 80% 650 Standard approval\r\n* > 20% (Material Exception) 75% Conditional See below\r\n* \u2264 65% LTV 650 Minimum score\r\n* > 65% LTV 730 Higher score required\r\n* Gross-up > 20% is treated as a material exception, subject to tighter LTV and beacon score requirements.\r\n**New to Canada (Insured & Conventional)**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score: 650\r\n**Temporary Residents**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score: 650\r\n**Non-Residents**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score: 650\r\n**Investor Properties**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score: 680\r\n**Basic Mortgage / TD Home Equity FlexLine**\r\n* Minimum Beacon Score: 650 (applies to both conventional and insured financing) (Applies: National)",
