        "description": "* No auto look back\r\n* Rate Drop available upon Request\r\n* Requests for rate decreases will not be accepted if received any later than three days before the mortgage closes\r\n* Should the customer wish to change the term and the product during the 120 day commitment period, the interest rate will be the applicable rate at the time of the change. (Applies: National)",
