        "policy": "Income - Foster & Adoption Income",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] ## Foster Care Income \u2013 Manulife Bank\r\n### Eligibility Requirements\r\n* Applicant(s) must reside in the subject property.\r\n* Confirmation from the Foster Care Agency must verify:\r\n * Borrower has been a foster parent for at least 2 years.\r\n * Amount of income earned previously.\r\n * Current number of children in care.\r\n * Current income earned.\r\n* The total number of children must not exceed six, including the borrower's own children.\r\n### Income Verification\r\nProvide:\r\n* Most recent paystub; and\r\n* 12 months of bank statements showing foster care income deposits.\r\n### Income Treatment\r\n* Foster Care Income is considered a fixed income source and is not subject to averaging.\r\n### Loan-to-Value Restriction\r\n* Maximum 90% LTV applies where Foster Care Income exceeds 50% of total qualifying income. (Applies: National)",
