        "id": 43,
        "policy": "Credit History: Bruised credit, consumer proposals, bankruptcy",
        "description": "## Collections, Judgments, Bankruptcies and Consumer Proposals \u2013 Manulife Bank\r\n### Collections and Judgments\r\n* All outstanding collections and judgments reported on the borrower's credit bureau must be investigated.\r\n* All judgments must be paid in full prior to funding for purchases and refinances.\r\n### Standard, High Ratio and Investment Programs\r\n* No bankruptcies within the last 2 years.\r\n* No consumer proposals within the last 2 years.\r\n* No executions or judgments.\r\n### Small Business Owner and Equity Advantage Programs\r\n* No bankruptcies within the last 6 years.\r\n* No consumer proposals within the last 6 years.\r\n* No executions or judgments. (Applies: National)",
        "isAccepted": null
