        "description": "**Manulife Bank Select Program**\r\n* For this product, multiple payment frequency options are available, including:\r\n* Monthly\r\n* Semi-monthly\r\n* Bi-weekly\r\n* Bi-weekly accelerated\r\n* Weekly\r\n* Weekly accelerated\r\n* These flexible frequencies are designed to give borrowers more control over their cash flow and potential interest savings, particularly with accelerated options.\r\n**All Other Manulife Programs (e.g., Manulife One, SBO Program, Healthcare Professional Program)**\r\n* Monthly payment frequency is the only available option.\r\n* This applies to sub-accounts in Manulife One and other fixed-term loan setups (Applies: National)",
