        "policy": "Rentals - Amortization, LTV, Debt Servicing & Gifted Down Payment",
        "description": "**Manulife One - Investment Property Program**\r\n**Amortization**\r\n* 30 years \r\n**Maximum Loan-to-Value (LTV)**\r\n* Single-Family (Rental): Up to 80% LTV total.\r\n* Maximum 50% of the value in the HELOC (Manulife One main account).\r\n* Remaining portion (30%) must be in a non-re-advanceable sub-account.\r\n* Condominiums: Up to 75% LTV total.\r\n* Same 50% max in HELOC and balance in non-re-advanceable term sub-account.\r\n**GDS/TDS Requirements**\r\n* The maximum GDS/TDS allowed is 40%.\r\n**Gifted Down Payment**\r\n* Permitted, as long as it meets standard documentation and eligibility requirements (Applies: National)",
