        "description": "* With regards to a client buying a rental but without a principal residence, it would depend on the situation:\r\n* If they rent a place as their residence (not the subject property) then current rent they pay needs to be included as a debt obligation and included in ratios\r\n* If they live at home with their parents for example\u2013 we include a $650 rent payment as a debt obligation in ratios. (Applies: National)",
