        "description": "* Manulife Bank only accepts Equifax credit reports.\r\n* We are no longer allowing submission agents to achieve status or get access to programs like Equity Advantage, so please do not use a submission agent or your deal will be returned to you. Please be signed up with Manulife directly.\r\n**Important Tip**\r\n* Please make sure that you are requesting the maximum mortgage amount as readvancing mortgage subaccounts ((65% LTV on a standard deal, 50% LTV on investment, SBO and Equity Advantage). IF you put it all into one NOT readvancing subaccount, your clients will never gain access to the additional funds in the HELOC. (Applies: National)",
