        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Medical Professionals Program**\r\n- The MCAP Medical Professionals Program allows borrowers who have recently completed or are in the process of completing their residency/fellowship in the last 12 to 24 months to obtain financing for the purchase of a new home. The program qualifies borrowers on projected income that is aligned with their medical specialization. \r\n**Who Is Eligible for the MCAP Medical Professionals Program?**\r\n- ***Physicians:*** \r\n - Medical professionals registered or enrolled in a recognized medical residency or fellowship program in Canada. \r\n - Newly practicing physicians who began their practice within the last 24 months. \r\n - Foreign-trained physicians legally entitled to practice in Canada, licensed by a provincial college, and who completed their program within the last 24 months. \r\n- ***Dentists:***\r\n - Dental students in their final year of residency, fellowship, or recognized program of study in Canada. \r\n - Newly practicing dentists who completed their program within the past 24 months. \r\n- ***Veterinarians:*** \r\n - Veterinary students in their final year of residency, fellowship, or recognized program of study in Canada. \r\n - Newly practicing veterinarians who completed their program within the past 12 months. \r\n**Purpose** \r\n- Insured loans only\r\n- Purchase \r\n- Ports and Replacements \r\n- Insured Transfers (Sagen only) \r\n- Insured Collateral Transfers (Sagen only) \r\n(NOTE: Not available in Quebec at this time) \r\n**Product/Term** \r\n- 1 - 5 Year Fixed \r\n- MCAP Value-Flex Fixed and ARM \r\n- 5 Year VIP MPower ARM ( Not Eligible: Secondary Homes, BFS Insured, Borrowed Downpayment and New to Canada Programs ) \r\n**Loan to Value**\r\n- Maximum 95% LTV \r\n**Minimum/Maximum Loan Amount**\r\n- Minimum: $45,000 \r\n- Maximum: $899,999.99 \r\n**Occupancy**\r\n- Owner Occupied or Partially Owner Occupied \u2013 maximum 2 units \r\n**Amortization**\r\n- Minimum 5 years \r\n- Maximum 25 years \r\n**Qualifying Rate**\r\n- Greater of the contract rate + 2% or the Minimum \r\n**Qualifying Rate**\r\n- GDS/TDS 39%/44% \r\n**Credit Requirements**\r\n- Minimum 650 credit score for each applicant \r\n**Down Payment** \r\n- Minimum 10% \r\n - Minimum 5% from own resources, the remainder can be gifted from an immediate family member\r\n_Note:_ *This program is not available in Quebec at this time. Expected launch date in late 2023/early 2024 (Applies: National)",
