        "policy": "Second Homes / Family Plan",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **MCAP Secondary Home Program Overview**\r\n* With MCAP\u2019s Secondary Home Program, financing is available up to 95% loan-to-value (LTV) for the purchase of a second home. The secondary residence must be:\r\n* Occupied by the purchaser or a relative on a rent-free basis, and\r\n* Designed and suitable for year-round occupancy.\r\n**Eligible MCAP Products**\r\n* Insured, Insurable, Uninsurable\r\n* Fixed Rate: 3\u20135 Year Term\r\n* Variable Interest and Payment (ARM): VIP M-Power (3 and 5 Year Term)\r\n* MCAP Value-Flex (Fixed and ARM)\r\n* MCAP Fusion Mortgage\r\n* MCAP Safeguard\r\n**Eligible Purposes**\r\n* Purchase\r\n* Refinance\r\n* Purchase Plus Improvements\r\n* Transfer\r\n**Eligible Property Types**\r\n* Owner-occupied or occupied by a relative on a rent-free basis (maximum 1 unit)\r\n* Year-round occupancy is required.\r\n* For island properties: year-round bridge or ferry access is mandatory.\r\n* The borrower must not have any restrictions on occupying the property year-round.\r\n**Typical features of eligible properties include:**\r\n* Permanent heat source\r\n* Acceptable year-round water supply\r\n* Permanent, primary electricity source (generators are supplementary only)\r\n* Proper insulation for year-round living\r\n* Indoor kitchen and bathroom facilities\r\n* Year-round vehicular access via public roadways\r\n**Ineligible properties:**\r\n* Timeshares\r\n* Life leases\r\n* Properties in rental pools\r\n* Seasonal-access or seasonal-use properties\r\n* Mobile homes\r\n* Note: Vacation properties may qualify if all criteria above are met.\r\n**Loan Amounts**\r\n* Minimum Loan: $50,000\r\n* Minimum Collateral Transfer: $100,000\r\n* Maximum Insured: $1,374,999\r\n* Maximum Insurable: $799,999\r\n* Uninsurable: Based on property location and product-specific LTV limits\r\n**Maximum Loan-to-Value (LTV)**\r\n* MCAP Fusion Mortgage:\r\n* Line of Credit (HELOC) LTV: Max 65%\r\n* Combined LTV (CLTV): Max 80% (across all segments)\r\n* Fixed & ARM Products:\r\n* Purchase / Transfer: Max 95% LTV\r\n* Refinance: Max 80% LTV\r\n**Down Payment**\r\n* May come from gifted or personal resources\r\n* Note: Gifted down payments are not permitted for MCAP Fusion Mortgage\r\n**Mortgage Insurance**\r\n* Required for insured mortgages via CMHC, Sagen, or Canada Guaranty\r\n* Insurance approval must be obtained prior to commitment\r\n* Borrowers cannot have more than two CMHC-insured mortgages after closing\r\n**Minimum Credit Scores**\r\n* Fixed & ARM: 600+\r\n* MCAP Fusion Mortgage:\r\n* Primary applicant: minimum 680\r\n* Other applicants: minimum 650\r\n* Refinance: All applicants minimum 650\r\n**Documentation Requirements**\r\n* MCAP is responsible for confirming the property is not seasonal and meets general eligibility criteria. (Applies: National)",
