        "id": 65,
        "policy": "Maximum or Minimum Amounts",
        "description": "see \"Terms\" policy for different terms Maximum/Minimums.\r\n**Uninsurable Loans**\r\n* Minimum: $45,000\r\n* Maximum: $2,000,000\r\n* Note: Loan amounts over $950,000 are restricted to 5-year terms only.\r\n* Maximum Property Value/Purchase Price: Not applicable\r\n* Maximum LTV: 80%\r\n* Lending value is based on the lesser of appraised value or purchase price.\r\n**Insured/Insurable Loans**\r\n* Minimum: $45,000\r\n* Maximum: $924,999.99\r\n* Note: Some products or specials may differ. Contact your BDM for details.\r\n**Purchase Transactions**\r\nPurchase price must not exceed $999,999.99.\r\nNote * Maximum purchase price for high-ratio insured mortgages (LTV > 80%) is $1,499,999.\r\n**Transfer Transactions**\r\n* Lower of the following:\r\n* Original purchase price not to exceed $999,999.99\r\n* Current value not to exceed $999,999.99\r\n* Maximum LTV\r\n* Standard: 95%\r\n* 3\u20134 units: 90%\r\n* The lesser of the appraised value or purchase price will be used for lending purposes.\r\n**Tiering**\r\n* MCAP is excited to announce that we have made enhancements to our maximum lending amount tiers for Uninsurable loans in several markets across the country by:\r\n* Revising calculations based on 80% of the property value up to the tier limit, and 60% of the remaining value thereafter;\r\n* Expanding the definition of Greater Vancouver, Greater Montreal and Greater Toronto Areas;\r\n* Revising the tier limits across the country.\r\n* Please reach out to your BDM/BRM to confirm the new maximum LTV for any applications in markets with higher property values. (Applies: National)",
