        "description": "**Lump Sum Payments**\r\n* Payments can be made provided there is no default and are:\r\n* A minimum of $100 and total no more than 20% of the original principal mortgage amount\r\n* Made during the 12-month period following the interest adjustment date, each anniversary date or renewal date\r\n* Cannot be carried over from previous years\r\n**Increase in Payments**\r\n* Payments can be increased provided there is no default and:\r\n* Increased to a maximum of 20% of the current mortgage principal and interest payment\r\n* Increased during the 12-month period following the interest adjustment date, each anniversary date or renewal date\r\n* Cannot be carried over from previous years. (Applies: National)",
