        "id": 72,
        "policy": "Pre-Payment Penalties",
        "description": "**VIP MPower**\r\n* 3 months interest penalty based on the greater of the contract rate or MCAP Prime.\r\n**Standard Product**\r\n* Greater of 3 months interest or IRD (up to 5th anniversary, 3 months interest after the 5th anniversary)\r\n* 10% penalty reduction if refinanced with MCAP for term longer than current mortgage \r\n**Value Flex**\r\n* Full repayment before maturity can only occur if the property is sold to an unrelated borrower at fair market value or in the event the borrower is deceased\r\n* For a fixed ValueFlex up to the 5th anniversary Greater of 3 months interest or IRD\r\n* for a variable ValueFlex 3 months interest penalty is the greater of the contract rate or MCAP Prime\r\n**Fusion**\r\n* LOC segment no penalty\r\n* Standard Fixed or Variable (VIP MPower) segment same as above (Applies: National)",
        "isAccepted": null
