        "description": "**Appraisal Costs**\r\n* MCAP covers appraisal cost only on funded transfer files (MCAP orders appraisal after signed commitment).\r\n**Legal Fees & Penalties**\r\n* Standard Transfer:\r\n* MCAP covers legal fees.\r\n* Penalty & fees capped up to $3,000.\r\n* Capitalization not available if LTV > 95%.\r\n* Collateral Transfer / Fusion:\r\n* FCT/FNF legal fees:\r\n* Paid by MCAP \u2192 commission reduced by 10 bps.\r\n* Paid by client \u2192 standard commission applies.\r\n* Penalty + legal fees capped up to $3,000.\r\n* Discharge fee (if applicable) covered up to $300.\r\n* Additional FCT fees (for covenant changes, etc.) can be included in the $3,000 capitalization allowance if available (Applies: National)",
