        "policy": "Value Added Products",
        "description": "**MCAP Service Plans**\r\n**Home Appliance Service Plan (Alberta only)**\r\n* Complimentary Period: First 6 months.\r\n* Waiting Period: 30 days from registration.\r\n* Monthly Fee: $20.99 (+ tax).\r\n* Annual Coverage Limit: $5,000 total claims.\r\n* Coverage: Major household appliances (range, washer, dryer, dishwasher, fridge) with per-appliance annual caps.\r\n* Consultation Fee: $75 per service request.\r\n* Key Exclusions: Appliances over 12 years old, cosmetic damage, consumables, smart tech, certain non-functional parts.\r\n**Home System Service Plan (All British Columbia, Manitoba, Ontario, Nova Scotia and Prince Edward Island)**\r\n* Complimentary Period: First 6 months.\r\n* Waiting Period: 30 days from registration.\r\n* Monthly Fee: $23.99 (+ tax).\r\n* Annual Coverage Limit: $10,000 total claims.\r\n* Coverage: Major home systems (furnace, AC, electrical, plumbing, water heater) with per-system annual caps.\r\n* Consultation Fee: $50 per service request.\r\n* Key Exclusions: Systems over 20 years old, cosmetic damage, consumables, smart tech, certain non-functional parts. (Applies: National)",
