        "policy": "Income - Foster & Adoption Income",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] * Foster Income - cannot exceed 50% of the total income on the application\r\n* If LOE shows non-taxable income, gross up allowed. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
