        "id": 26,
        "policy": "New to Canada",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Eligible Properties** \r\n- Maximum 2 units (1 unit must be owner-occupied) \r\n- New construction closing within 120 days. (New Home Warranty enrollment must be confirmed.) \r\n- Existing resale properties \r\n- Minimum square footage required: 750 for a house and 500 for a condo \r\n**Borrower Qualification** \r\n- Must have immigrated to Canada within the last 60 months \r\n- Minimum 3 months full-time employment in Canada (exemptions for borrowers transferred under a corporate relocation program) \r\n- Must have a valid work permit (valid for at least 183 days after closing) or have obtained landed immigrant status \r\n- For 95% LTV, down payment must be from own resources; for LTVs less than 95%, a minimum of 5% must be from borrower's own resources, with the remainder allowed as a gift from an immediate family member \r\n- All debts held outside Canada must be included in the total debt servicing ratio (GDS/TDS), while rental income from outside Canada is excluded \r\n- Guarantors are not permitted \r\n- Foreign diplomats who do not pay tax in Canada are ineligible \r\n**Documentation / Information Requirements** \r\n- Valid work permit (valid for at least 183 days after closing) or verification of landed immigrant status \r\n- Income confirmation \r\n- Down payment confirmation \r\n- Purchase and Sale agreement \r\n**For LTV Up to 90%** \r\n- For existing rentals, 50% addback may be used \r\n- For non-subject rentals with multiple owners who are not on the subject application: only a portion of rental income is considered, but 100% of liabilities are factored \r\n**For LTV 90.01% \u2013 95%** \r\n- International credit bureau demonstrating a strong credit profile \r\n **OR** \r\n- Two alternative Canadian sources of credit demonstrating timely payments (no arrears) for the past 12 months, which include: \r\n - Rental payment history confirmed via a letter from the landlord and bank statements \r\n - One additional alternative source (such as hydro/utilities, telephone, cable, cell phone, or auto insurance), confirmed by a letter from the service provider or 12 months of billing statements \r\n> **Note:** Alternative sources of credit must come from a Canadian source. \r\n**Limitations** \r\nThis program is not available for: \r\n- Business for Self-Stated/Declared Income \r\n- Refinances \r\n- Vacation/Secondary Homes Program \r\n- Rental Properties \r\n- Borrowed Down Payment Sources. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
