        "policy": "Rentals - Amortization, LTV, Debt Servicing & Gifted Down Payment",
        "description": "**Amortization**\r\n**Insured**\r\n* 25 years max amortization\r\n**Uninsured**\r\n* 30 years max amortization \r\n**LTV**\r\n* Maximum LTV = 95%, but only in the case of an insured rental transfer with valid mortgage insurance.\r\n* For new insured/insurable rental purchases, the effective cap is 80% LTV (with borrower-paid insurance premium)\r\n* Uninsured 75% \r\n**Debt Servicing**\r\n* Insured\r\n* 680-900 39/44\r\n* Uninsured \r\n* 39/45 - LTI Less than 4.5 \r\n**Gifted Down Payment**\r\n* Gifted down not allowed (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
