        "policy": "PORT'S",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Port & Increase:**\r\n- Minimum increase $10K\r\n- If current rate is fixed we can blend/extend back to 5 year term, penalty is incorporated into blend calc but not charged on payout statement.\r\n- Blend option not available for VRM products, MCAP Fusion, Peace of Mind Cashback, RMG LRB or MCAP/RMG Safeguard\r\n- If taking current rates, penalty is reduced by 10%\r\n- Reinvestment fee (if applicable) is waived (MCAP brand)\r\n- Discharge fee reimbursement to maximum $200 (RMG brand only)\r\n- Broker paid on full loan amount regardless of which option they take\r\n**Port & Decrease:**\r\n- Remaining term, am & current rate are transferred to new property\r\n- No penalty unless new loan amount is outside their 20% lump sum allowance. If outside, standard penalty applies on the difference.\r\n- If taking current rates instead of transferring remaining term, penalty is applicable & reduced by 10%\r\n- Reinvestment fee (if applicable) is waived (MCAP brand)\r\n- Broker paid a flat $250 commission to transfer current rate/terms, full commission if taking new rate/term\r\n**Straight Port:**\r\n- Remaining term, am & current rate are transferred to new property\r\n- No penalty unless new loan amount is outside their 20% lump sum allowance. If outside, full penalty with 10% reduction\r\n- If taking current rates instead of transferring remaining term, penalty is applicable & reduced by 10%\r\n- Reinvestment fee (if applicable) is waived (MCAP brand)\r\n- Broker paid a flat $250 commission to transfer current rate/terms, full commission if taking new rate/term\r\n**Other port info:**\r\n- If currently in Value Flex, must stay within Value Flex to use their port options\r\n- Close dates between purchase and sale must be within 90 days of each other to utilize port options\r\n- If sale closes first, they will be charged full fees upon payout & reimbursed applicable penalty/reinvestment fees as above (Applies: National)",
