        "id": 45,
        "policy": "Condos",
        "description": "**BC Only**\r\n* Purchase Transactions\r\n* Require Purchase and Sale Agreement with completed Disclosure Statement\r\n * Refinance/Transfer\r\n* Completed MERIX BC Strata Properties Disclosure Statement/Strata Form B\r\n**All Properties**\r\n* If an assessment of required repairs is disclosed OR building envelope or structural repairs have been recently completed, we require the following to confirm full remediation:\r\n* 6 months Condo/strata minutes/AGM/SGM that confirm the property issue(s)\r\n* Copies of any Assessments as well as Engineers Report confirming the repairs completed to resolve the issue(s)8 Certificate of completion\r\n**Condo Conversions**\r\n* If the property was converted from another use, the following applies:\r\n* Property to not be tenanted at time of application\r\n* Property to be professionally renovated\r\n* Property to be located in area of compatible properties\r\n* Property to be of legal use\r\n**Alberta, Manitoba, Saskatchewan**\r\n* In addition to above, condo conversions completed in the last 5 years in these provinces are not eligible for financing.\r\n**Documentation Requirements (regarding Condo Conversions)**\r\n* Full appraisal to be provided regardless of LTV\r\n**Square Footage**\r\n* Condo: 500 sq. ft.*\r\n* Contact your BDM to discuss properties with square footage below these minimums. (Applies: National)",
