        "id": 1,
        "policy": "APV (Auto Property Valuation)",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] ***RMG will cover the cost of AVM.***\r\nTo qualify for AVM, Low Ratio Insurable and Uninsurable Loans must meet the following criteria: \r\nTransaction Types Eligible:\r\n- MLS Purchase\r\n- Standard Transfer / Collateral Transfer\r\n- Refinance\r\n- Maximum LTV: 80%\r\n- Maximum Property Value/Purchase Price\r\n- Insurable: $999,999\r\n- Uninsurable: $1,500,000\r\n- Higher beacon scores may apply for select products and promotions\r\n- Residential, maximum 4 units, and condos\r\n- Property size: up to 15 acres\r\n- ***Ineligible:*** Double-ended, Non-arm's length, Power of Sale, Leased Land, Purchase Plus Improvements, Private Sales\r\nIneligible Products/Programs: New to Canada, BFS - Insured, Home Account Plus\r\nIn order to facilitate successful AVM responses, it is very important that the information on the application be accurate as it relates to the property (Ex. Size, Taxes, Value, Postal Code, etc\u2026) otherwise an appraisal may be required (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
