        "policy": "Assignment Purchase Financing",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Assignments may be considered provided that**\r\n* Full assignment agreement and original offer to purchase to be provided\r\n* The purchase price to be used is the original price plus any fee paid to the original purchaser (the price as outlined in the assignment agreement)\r\n* If the builder charges a fee to consent to the assignment it is to be deducted from the assignment price\r\n* The lending value is to be determined by the lesser of the purchase price or the current appraised value\r\n* Builder consent/acknowledgement of the assignment\r\n**Documentation Requirements:**\r\n* Full assignment agreement and original offer to purchase to be obtained including all schedules, waivers, annexes\r\n* Full appraisal\r\n* Builder consent/acknowledgement of the assignment (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
