        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Cash Back Options** _(Based on total loan amount including insurance premiums if applicable)_\r\n- 1% \r\n- 1.5% \r\n- 2% \r\n- 3%\r\n_Refer to RMG Rate Sheet for pricing details_\r\n**Eligibility**\r\n- Minimum 680 Beacon for at least 1 qualifying applicant. Minimum 600 for all other applicants.\r\n- Standard 5yr ARM or Fixed product only.\r\n- Purchases and Transfers (Standard and Collateral)\r\n- Cash Back cannot be used for Down Payment\r\n- Broker buy downs from Commission allowed\r\n- Not Available: Preapprovals, Secondary Homes, BFS Insured Program, New to Canada, Assumptions, Blend and Increases\r\n- Please indicate the Cash Back percentage and include \u201cRMG POM Cash Back\u201d in your submission notes.\r\n**Payout Repayment Amount as % of Cash Back Amount** _(this in addition to regular prepayment penalty for variable and fixed)_\r\n- 1st year from IAD 100% \r\n- 2nd year from IAD 80%\r\n- 3rd year from IAD 60% \r\n- 4th year from IAD 40%\r\n- 5th year from IAD 20% \r\n**Payment Options**\r\n- Weekly, Bi-Weekly, Semi-monthly, Monthly (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
