        "id": 9,
        "policy": "Income - BFS Stated (Sagen & CG Program)",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Purpose**\r\n* Eligible:\r\n* Insured/Insurable Purchases only (client pays insurance premium for LTV >65%)\r\n* Purchase\r\n* Ports and Replacements\r\n* Purchase Plus Improvements\r\n* Not Eligible:\r\n* Pre-approvals, Secondary Homes, Small Rental Program, Transfers, Refinances, AVM\r\n**LTV**\r\n* Maximum: 90%\r\n* Borrower-paid default insurance required for LTVs over 65%\r\n**Property Value**\r\n* Insured: Maximum $1,499,999\r\n* Insurable: Maximum $999,999\r\n**Amortization**\r\n* Minimum: 5 years\r\n* Maximum: 25 years\r\n* 30 years permitted for Insured only, if:\r\n* Property is owner-occupied (or occupied rent-free by an immediate family member) AND either:\r\n* At least one borrower is a First-Time Home Buyer (FTHB), or\r\n* The property is new construction\r\n**Borrower Eligibility**\r\n* 80% LTV: Minimum 650 credit score for all applicants\r\n* \u226480% LTV: Minimum 680 credit score for at least one applicant\r\n* Must operate a business for a minimum of 2 years\r\n* Maximum GDS/TDS: 39% / 44%\r\n* At least 2 trade lines with 2-year history\r\n* No mortgage, installment, or revolving credit delinquencies in past 12 months\r\n* No mortgage defaults in past 7 years\r\n* No prior bankruptcy\r\n* No judgments or unpaid collections in last 12 months\r\n* No property or income tax arrears\r\n**Qualifying Income**\r\n* Income stated on application undergoes a Reasonability Test (based on industry, business length, and size).\r\n* Proof of self-employment for minimum 2 years required.\r\n* Must provide most recent Notice of Assessment (NOA).\r\n* Must disclose annual gross BFS revenue, business type, and ownership structure in submission notes.\r\n* Commission income not eligible.\r\n**To Confirm 2+ Years Self-Employment**\r\n* Sole Proprietorships & Partnerships \u2013 one of:\r\n* Business License\r\n* GST/HST Return Summary\r\n* Accountant-prepared T1 Generals + Statement of Business Activities (last 2 years)\r\n* Audited Financial Statements (last 2 years, prepared & signed by Chartered Accountant)\r\n* Corporations \u2013 one of:\r\n* Articles of Incorporation\r\n* Business/Corporation Search\r\n* 2 years T2 Corporate Income Tax Returns\r\n* Business License\r\n* Business Credit Report\r\n* Audited Financial Statements (last 2 years, prepared & signed by Chartered Accountant)\r\n* Note: Income from other sources (rental, investment, pension, commission, etc.) must be confirmed with full standard documentation requirements. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
