        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Broker Requirements**\r\n* Upon issuance of the commitment, the underwriter will send the following documents to the Broker:\r\n* Must be a regular charge mortgage from a satisfactory financial institution, no collateral mortgages\r\n* Payout Authorization Form\r\n* Mortgagor\u2019s Acknowledgement\r\n* Authorization to close a Line of Credit (as applicable)\r\n* Once the file is broker complete, the file will then be transferred to our Funding Team.\r\n* The Broker is required to answer any mortgage-related questions, including any of the mortgage processes as well as questions pertaining to legal documents.\r\n**Property Guidelines**\r\n* Standard property guidelines apply:\r\n* Owner-occupied: 1\u20134 units\r\n* Secondary homes: 1 unit only\r\n* Rentals (Insured/Insurable only): 1\u20134 units\r\n* Single unit rentals must meet:\r\n* Insured \u2013 original loan funded as owner-occupied\r\n* Insurable \u2013 original loan funded prior to Nov 30, 2016\r\n**Products**\r\n* Insured / Insurable / Uninsurable\r\n* Standard 3\u20135 Year Fixed\r\n* 3 and 5 Year Standard ARM\r\n* Low Rate Basic Fixed / ARM\r\n* Rentals:\r\n* Insured/Insurable only\r\n* Standard 5-year Fixed/ARM only\r\n**Minimum / Maximum Loan Amounts**\r\n* Minimum:\r\n* Standard Fixed/ARM \u2013 $45K\r\n* Second Home & Rentals \u2013 $50K\r\n* Low Rate Basic \u2013 $75K\r\n* Maximum:\r\n* Insurable Low Ratio \u2013 $799,999\r\n* Insured High Ratio \u2013 $1,374,999\r\n* Uninsurable \u2013 $2M*\r\n* Max loan amount is subject to property location\r\n* New to Canada borrowers are now eligible , applies to insured /insurable only (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
