        "policy": "Maximum or Minimum Amounts",
        "description": "**Loan Amounts**:\r\n**Uninsurable Loans**:\r\n* Minimum $45,000\r\n* Maximum $2,000,000\r\n* Loan amounts over $950,000 - 5 year term only\r\n* If needed, please contact BDM for more specific information on our sliding scale\r\n**Low Rate Basic**:\r\n* Uninsurable\r\n* Minimum $75,000\r\n* Maximum $2,000,000\r\n**Insured/Insurable**:\r\n* Minimum $75,000\r\n* Maximum $924,999.99\r\n* The minimum and maximum loan amounts for some products or specials may differ. Please contact BDM if you have product specific questions.\r\n***insured mortgages and 30-year amortization***\r\n- The maximum mortgage amount for an insured property is $1,375,000. This is based on a $1.5 million purchase price and the required down payment per insurer guidelines (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
