        "id": 65,
        "policy": "Payment Frequency",
        "description": "* if selecting other than monthly will default to accelerated - must indicate \"non\" accelerated in comments\r\n**Weekly**\r\n* Payment is due every 7 days on any day from Monday to Friday.\r\nCalculation is as follows:\r\n* Monthly payment x 12/52\r\n* Accelerated - Monthly payment/4\r\n**Biweekly**\r\n* Payment is due every 14 days on any day from Monday to Friday. \r\nCalculation is as follows:\r\n* Monthly payment x 12/26\r\n* Accelerated - Monthly payment/2\r\n**Monthly**\r\n* Payment is due once a month on any date.\r\n**Semi-Monthly**\r\nPayment is due every 15 days(monthly payment / 2) on the following available dates:\r\n* 1st and 16th\r\n* 2nd and 17th\r\n* 3rd and 18th\r\n* 4th and 19th\r\n* 5th and 20th\r\n* 6th and 21st\r\n* 7th and 22nd\r\n* 8th and 23rd\r\n* 9th and 24th\r\n* 10th and 25th\r\n* 11th and 26th\r\n* 12th and 27th\r\n* 13th and 28th. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
