        "id": 83,
        "policy": "Sliding Scale",
        "description": "* 80% on $1,250,000 and 60% on rest for houses/townhomes on anywhere in BC except GVA or Victoria\r\n* 80% on $1,800,000 and 60% on rest for houses/townhomes in Victoria\r\n* 80% on $2,250,000 and 60% on rest for houses/townhomes in GVA\r\n**British Columbia**\r\n- Area: \r\n - Greater Vancouver Area ( _Greater Vancouver Area is defined as: Anmore, Belcarra, Bowen Island, Delta, Langley, Maple Ridge, Lion's Bay, Pitt Meadows, Vancouver, North Vancouver, West Vancouver, Burnaby, Coquitlam, New Westminster, Port Coquitlam, Port Moody, Richmond, Surrey, White Rock_ )\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $2,250,000\r\n - Condo: $1,250,000\r\n - Victoria ( _Victoria is defined as: Central Victoria, Esquimalt, Colwood, Cordova Bay, Langford, Metchosin, Oak Bay, Saanich (East, Central, North, West, Saanichton), Sidney, View Royal_ ) \r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,800,000\r\n - Condo: $1,000,000\r\n - Abbotsford, Mission, Squamish & Whistler\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,250,000\r\n - Condo: $1,000,000\r\n- Rest of British Columbia\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,250,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n**Alberta**\r\n- Area:\r\n - Calgary (including Airdrie, Cochrane, Chestermere & Rocky View)\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,000,000\r\n - Condo: $1,000,000\r\n - Edmonton (including Beaumont, Spruce Grove, Stony Plain, Sherwood Park, Fort Saskatchewan, St. Albert, Morinville, Leduc, Devon & Sturgeon County)\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,000,000\r\n - Condo: $1,000,000\r\n - Rest of Alberta\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $750,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n**Saskatchewan**\r\n- Area:\r\n - Regina & Saskatoon\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $750,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n - Rest of Saskatchewan\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $700,000\r\n - Condo: $500,000\r\n**Manitoba**\r\n- Area:\r\n - Winnipeg\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $750,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n - Rest of Manitoba\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $700,000\r\n - Condo: $500,000\r\n**Ontario**\r\n- Area:\r\n - Greater Toronto Area _Greater Toronto Area is defined as: City of Toronto (Toronto, East York, Etobicoke, North York, Scarborough, York), York Region (Aurora, East Gwillimbury, Bradford, Georgina, King, Markham, New Market, Richmond Hill, Vaughan, Concord, Maple, Woodbridge, Thornhill, Whitchurch Stouffville), Peel Region (Brampton, Caledon, Mississauga), Halton Region (Burlington, Halton Hills, Milton, Oakville), Durham Region (Ajax, Brock, Clarington, Oshawa, Pickering, Scugog, Uxbridge, Whitby)_\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $2,250,000\r\n - Condo: $1,250,000\r\n - Rest of Ontario\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,000,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n**Quebec**\r\n- Area:\r\n - Greater Montreal Area _Greater Montreal Area is defined as: Ahuntsic, Beaconsfield, Dollard-des-Ormeaux, Dorval, Kirkland, Lachine, Montreal, Montreal West, Mont Royal, Notre-Dame-de-Grace, Outremont, Pierrefonds, Pointe Claire, Westmount_\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,500,000\r\n - Condo: $1,000,000\r\n - Rest of Quebec\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $1,000,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n**Nova Scotia**\r\n- Area:\r\n - Halifax\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $750,000\r\n - Condo: $750,000\r\n - Rest of Nova Scotia\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $700,000\r\n - Condo: $500,000\r\n**New Brunswick**\r\n- Area:\r\n - All of New Brunswick\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $700,000\r\n - Condo: $500,000\r\n**Prince Edward Island**\r\n- Area:\r\n - All of Prince Edward Island\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $700,000\r\n - Condo: $500,000\r\n**Newfoundland**\r\n- Area:\r\n - All of Newfoundland\r\n - Single Family Dwelling or Townhouse: $700,000\r\n - Condo: $500,000\r\n**Example:**\r\n- Property location \u2013 Etobicoke\r\n- Property Type \u2013 Single Family Home\r\n- Purchase Price \u2013 $2,500,000\r\n - 80% of tier limit - $2,250,000 x 80% = $1,800,000\r\n - 60% of remainder - $250,000 x 60% = $150,000\r\n**Max loan consideration for financing = $1,950,000\r\n*Ineligible Programs \u2013 Second Home, Small Rental. Please refer to program PDFs for max loan amounts.** (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
        "isAccepted": null
