        "description": "**Minimum required:**\r\n* Single Family Dwelling/Townhouse: 750 sq. ft.\r\n* Condo: 500 sq. ft.\r\n* Contact your BDM to discuss properties with square footage below these minimums. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
