        "policy": "Sliding Scale",
        "description": "**Owner Occupied** - _Residential up to 4 units including Type A vacation homes_\r\n- Beacon Score: 600+ \r\n- LTVR - GTA (excluding condos): \r\n - 80% of the first $2.0MM, 50% of the remainder\r\n - Maximum Mortgage amount of $2.25MM\r\n - Maximum LOC amount of $1.25MM\r\n- LTVR - all other markets (including GTA condos): \r\n - 80 % of the first $1MM, 50% of the remainder\r\n - Maximum Mortgage amount of $2MM\r\n - Maximum LOC amount of $1MM\r\n - Condo mortgages over $1MM on a case-by-case basis\r\n**Non-Owner Occupied**\r\n- Beacon Score: 600+ \r\n- LTVR - GTA: \r\n - 80% of the first $1.75MM\r\n - Maximum Mortgage amount of $1.25MM\r\n - Maximum LOC amount of $1.0MM\r\n- LTVR - all other markets: \r\n - 80% of the first $1.0MM, 50% of the remainder\r\n - Maximum Mortgage amount of $1MM\r\n - Maximum LOC amount of $750K (Applies: Ontario)",
