        "description": "**Insured & Insurable**\r\n* no sliding scale\r\n**Uninsured**\r\n* LTV Sliding Scale Applies\r\n**Greater Toronto Area (GTA)**\r\n* Max LTV: 80% of the first $2,000,000 - Sliding Scale 50% - Second Remainder\r\n**Major Urban**\r\n* Urban Centre must have a total population of at least 100,000 or more\r\n* Max LTV: 80% of the first $1,500,000 \u2013 50% of the remaining balance\r\n**Urban**\r\n* All other cities with populations of 30,000 or more.\r\n* Max LTV: 80% of the first $1,000,000 \u2013 50% of the remaining balance \r\n**Non-Urban** \r\n* All other cities with populations under 30,000. Default insurance is required for all properties located in or near Non-Urban centres with a population base <5000 and greater than 50km from an Urban or Major Urban centre.\r\n* Max LTV: 80% of the first $800,000, 50% of the remaining balance (Applies: Ontario)",
