        "description": "* Sliding scale: up to 80% LTV for 1st $1.2M and 60% LTV of the balance - no cap (GTA and GOA owner occupied)\r\n* Always subject to risk and due diligence so could be less (Applies: Ontario, Quebec)",
        "isAccepted": null
