        "description": "* Square footage is reviewed case-by-case and subject to eligibility. In general, if the property is unique or has potential marketability/risk issues we may apply the following cap/restrictions : up to 65% LTV and 20 year amortization (Applies: Ontario, Quebec)",
        "isAccepted": null
