        "policy": "Non - Full Service / Limited Feature Mortgages",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Overview**\r\n* The 5-Year No Frills Mortgage allows homeowners to obtain financing into their primary residence at the lowest fixed rate. While there is less flexibility to refinance or switch their mortgage, this product is ideal for new homeowners looking for a low-cost mortgage with certainty they will remain in their home for the five-year term.\r\n**Key Highlights and Benefits**\r\n* Term length \u2013 5 years (60 months)\r\n* Product is available only for purchase or switch.\r\n* No ports, no assumptions permitted.\r\n* Must fund within 120 days.\r\n* Eligible for Servus Profit Share Rewards.\r\n**Product Eligibility**\r\n* Product not available for refinances, or progress draws.\r\n* Mortgage must fully fund within 120 days.\r\n* Property must be owner-occupied (rentals, recreational properties are not eligible).\r\n* Rural properties are not eligible.\r\n* Property value under $1 million.\r\n* Maximum 25-year amortization.\r\n* Servus membership is required.\r\n* Minimum Beacon \u2013 680 with GDS/TDS of 35%/42%.\r\n* Minimum Beacon \u2013 720 with GDS/TDS of 39%/44%.\r\n* Property must be single family detached or semi-\r\ndetached (condos are not eligible).\r\n**Additional Details**\r\n* Not available within a Flex-Line. Single term product only.\r\n* Only available for high ratio insured or select insurable mortgages.\r\n* Prepayment privilege of annual maximum 20% lump- sum and 20% total increase to monthly payment.\r\n* Full repayment before maturity can only occur if the property is sold to an unrelated borrower at fair market value or in the event the borrower is deceased. Full prepayment penalty applies.\r\n* No early renewals, blend and extend, or refinance in the middle of the term. Any requests of these events require full payout with prepayment penalty and a repricing of the rate/term must be to current market rates (Applies: Alberta)",
