        "policy": "Bridge Financing",
        "description": "**Bridge Financing**\r\n* Product Type: Interim / Bridge Financing\r\n* Purpose: Short-term financing to cover the gap between purchase closing and sale proceeds of an existing home.\r\n**Eligibility**\r\n* Existing property must have a firm (unconditional) sale\r\n* Servus involvement required in most cases:\r\n* Holds existing mortgage and/or new mortgage, or\r\n* Financing new purchase with existing home free & clear\r\n* Exceptions for external lenders may be considered\r\n**Loan Details**\r\n* Max Term: Up to 90 days\r\n* Payments: Interest-only\r\n* Repayment: automatically paid out from sale proceeds\r\n* Max Amount: Limited to required down payment\r\n* LTV: Based on net equity (after mortgage payout, fees, commissions, closing costs)\r\n**Requirements**\r\n* Signed, unconditional purchase & sale agreements (both properties)\r\n* Assignment of sale proceeds (via lawyer)\r\n* Lawyer confirmation for private sales (conditions removed) (Applies: Alberta)",
