        "id": 54,
        "policy": "HELOC Products - General",
        "description": "- Retail Collateral Mortgage is registered on title for 100% of the property value (unless otherwise requested). Up to 80% is then available for use.\r\n- Must qualify using the higher of actual rate +2.00% OR benchmark rate over 25 years max (a mortgage under FlexLine can be posted for 30 years, but must qualify at 25 years)\r\n- **Owner-Occupied Primary (up to 40 acres)**\r\n - Term loan products are not re-advanceable, any paid down portion is deemed a permanent reduction\r\n - Cannot be readvanced until the LTV is less than 65%\r\n- **Other Residential Properties** (owner-occupied up to 160 acres, non-owner occupied property)\r\n - Can be structured using a variety of mortgage products (term loans, AODs)\r\n - Cannot be readvanced until the LTV is less than 65%.\r\n**Subject Property Guidelines**\r\n- Single family detached OR multi-family dwelling; up to and including a four-plex*\r\n - *Units must be individually titled. At least one unit must be Owner-Occupied. Flex-Line available on owner-occupied portion only.\r\n- Apartment-style condominiums must be self-contained (i.e., must include in-suite laundry)\r\n- Can be structured as a 1st charge mortgage and the LTV decreases if over 40 acres\r\n**Payment Features**\r\n- Payment Structure\r\n - Interest-Only payment required on revolving portion\r\n- Additional Payments\r\n - HELOC under the Flex-Line is open for repayment. Other mortgage products follow the repayment terms and conditions of that product.\r\n- Qualifying Payment for Application Purposes\r\n - The higher of the benchmark OR posted rate + 2.00% over 25 year maximum amortization\r\n_Note: **Refer to applicable mortgage product information sheet for prepayment options on Amending Agreements_ (Applies: Alberta)",
