        "policy": "Rate Drop Policies",
        "description": "**Rate Reduction Requests \u2013 Pre-Documentation Policy**\r\n* Rate reduction requests will be considered only if received prior to documentation.\r\n* Requests must be submitted before mortgage instructions are prepared.\r\n* The request must be made no later than 10 calendar days prior to closing.\r\n**Important Exclusions**\r\n* This policy does not apply to special rate offers or rate buydowns that were already applied to the original commitment.\r\n* Any rate that includes a custom buydown, rate discount, or special promotional pricing is excluded from further reduction.\r\n**Broker Action Required**\r\n* Email all rate reduction requests to:\r\n* BrokerMortgages@servus.ca\r\n* Servus underwriters will:\r\n*Review file eligibility\r\n* Reprice the rate (if applicable)\r\n* Reissue a commitment with the updated rate (if approved)\r\n**Notes**\r\n* Members do not automatically receive the lowest rate during the rate hold period.\r\n* The maximum permitted rate buydown is 0.50% of the purchase price (Applies: Alberta)",
