        "policy": "Income - Disability",
        "description": "* Disability income will be considered provided 2 months history supporting documentation is obtained in conjunction with verification of the pension as long term. Peoples Bank will gross-up long-term disability on non-taxable income only, as follows: \r\n* If less than or equal to $30k, gross-up by 25%. \r\n* >$30k gross-up by 35%.\r\n* NOTE: only Long Term/Permanent Disability Benefits confirmed in writing by the provider as non-taxable qualify for gross up.\" (Applies: National)",
