        "description": "**Employer Pension**\r\n* Income is to be verified with any 2 of the following:\r\n* Most recent T4A\r\n* Most recent pension stub/pension statement showing the pension amount\r\n* Recent account statements showing 3 months of consecutive receipt\r\n* Most recent NOA\r\n* Letter from previous employer/pension administrator stating the pension amount\r\n**Public Pension**\r\n* Income is to be verified with any 1 of the following:\r\n* Most recent T4A\r\n* Most recent Pension stub/pension statement\r\n* Recent account statement showing at least 1 pension deposit\r\n* Most recent NOA\r\n* NOTE: Peoples Bank will only gross up income by 25% on non-taxable income. Government/Public and Employer Pensions are taxable sources of income and not eligible for gross up.\" (Applies: National)",
