        "id": 83,
        "policy": "Rentals - General Information",
        "description": "**Description:**\r\n\u2022 The Investment Property Program provides qualified borrowers the ability to purchase an investment property (non-owner occupied) property.\r\n**Key Features:**\r\n* Fixed and Adjustable-Rate Options available.\r\n* Borrower can be Individual or a non-operating Holding Company with personal guarantee.\r\n**Eligible Transactions:**\r\n* Purchases\r\n* Purchase Plus Improvements\r\n* Switch/Transfer\" (Applies: National)",
