        "description": "**Peoples Bank's terms for the Standard Charge transfer program:**\r\n* Min. Amortization of 10 years.\r\n o Insured mortgages with remaining amortizations >25 years and original purchase price > $1million are acceptable under CMHC\u2019s grandfathering provisions as long as the existing terms of the mortgage are not altered.\r\n* Maximum amortization:\r\n o Conventional switches with an \u2018insurable\u2019 response for bulk insurance may have an amortization not to exceed the lesser of the remaining amortization as per the original amortization schedule or 25 years, unless originally funded prior to October 17, 2016. Please see your BDM about grandfathered loans with amortization over 25 years.\r\n**Documentation:**\r\n\u2022 Confirmation of property details, including the legal description. Acceptable forms may be property or tax assessments that include all property information, old MLS listings, old appraisals, plans and specs for newer homes.\r\n\u2022 Confirmation of property tax amounts and that they are not in arrears.\r\n\u2022 Confirmation of current mortgage details.\r\n\u2022 Confirmation of Valid Fire Insurance\r\n\u2022 For Condo/Strata properties: Homeowner (liability & contents) Insurance for the subject unit is required which covers, unit damages and liability, above and beyond the standard insurance coverage provided by the condominium corporation. \r\n\u2022 Full income/employment documentation.\" (Applies: National)",
