        "description": "[ACCEPTED] - Leveraging this data-driven solution, we\u2019ve streamlined valuations and reduced the number of full appraisals needed\u2014saving your clients time and money. In some cases, home values can be generated and supported within hours of submission.\r\n* An Equitable Bank valuation offers you and your clients a consistent, trustworthy, fast, and low-cost solution. $375.00\r\n* Our cascading model of solutions are all provided at the same cost\r\n* Hybrid Valuation\r\n* Industry-leading valuation technology combined with the expertise of a certified appraiser for a cost-effective and accurate valuation. It uses approximately 250 data points with industry-recognized confidence scores\u2014with results provided within four hours and without setting foot on the property.\r\n* Desktop/Drive-By Appraisal\r\n* A market value estimate based on information from reliable third-party sources, such as municipal records and MLS\u00ae data. In some cases, an appraiser may drive by the property. \r\n* Full Appraisal\r\n* A market value estimate based on measurements, interior and exterior inspection, photos, and supporting analysis of relevant information.\r\n* As Canada\u2019s Challenger Bank\u2122, we remain committed to finding innovative, efficient, and cost-effective processes, so that you can pass them on to your clients\u2014and grow your business.\r\n* To find out more about how an Equitable Bank valuation can benefit your client, reach out to your sales representative today (Applies: National)",
