        "policy": "Rentals - Area, Maximum Doors & Net Worth Requirements",
        "description": "**Area**\r\n* Rentals under Near Prime must be in eligible markets defined under the sliding scale \r\n* GTA (e.g., Toronto, Mississauga, Brampton, etc.) \u2013 Max LTV 80% up to $2M, remainder at 50%\r\n* Major Urban (cities \u2265100,000 population such as Ottawa, Kitchener-Waterloo, London, Barrie, Kingston, etc.) \u2013 Max LTV 80% up to $1.5M, remainder at 50%\r\n* Urban (cities \u226530,000 such as Peterborough, Sudbury, Thunder Bay, etc.) \u2013 Max LTV 80% up to $1M, remainder at 50%\r\n* Non-Urban (population under 30,000) \u2013 Max LTV 80% up to $800K, remainder at 50% (Applies: Ontario)",
