        "description": "* 80% of 1st 1.5 million then 70% of next 1.5 to 2.5 million then 60% for the remainder owner occupied (not construct) to a maximum mortgage amount of 5 million.\r\n* 80% of the first $2.25 million, then 60% of the remaining value for owner-occupied, non-construction single-family homes/townhomes in the Greater Vancouver Area. (Applies: British Columbia)",
        "isAccepted": null
