        "policy": "Rentals - General Information",
        "description": "**Rental and investment financing applies to residential rental and investment properties (up to 20 acres)**\r\n* Property types include:\r\n* Single-family dwellings\r\n* Strata units\r\n* Multi-units up to and including 4 doors\r\n* Construction of investment/rental properties\r\n* Refinances of rental properties\r\n**Appraisal Requirements**\r\n* A full appraisal is required for determining lending values on rental and investment properties.\r\n* Automated valuations (like Landcor or BC Assessment) are not accepted.\r\n**Miscellaneous Conditions**\r\n* Properties must not be used for commercial or agricultural activity as a source of income (hobby farms may be considered separately).\r\n* Properties held within a rental pool, fractional interest, a company, or hotels/resorts are not eligible.\r\n* Minimum property size for financing is 600 sq. ft. for condos/apartments/row homes. (Applies: British Columbia)",
