        "id": 71,
        "policy": "Pre Approvals & Rate Holds",
        "description": "* We do not offer pre-approvals without a subject property, looking only at the borrower\u2019s affordability. We will approve a live deal with subjects. \r\n* Rates will be held for 120 days \r\n* Approvals will expire after 120 days, and once they expire, a new application must be submitted. \r\n* The file will be subject to underwriting guidelines and/or product. We will automatically drop a rate if rates change between approval and funding.\r\n* If a file\u2019s Rate Guarantee expires, we will not roll forward to the next rate increase nor provide lookback guarantees. The deal will be priced at current interest rates without a valid guarantee.\r\n* Brokers may request subsequent rate guarantees after an initial rate guarantee. Only the latest guarantee will be valid. All prior guarantees are invalid; only one guarantee may be active at a time and will always be the latest offer.\r\n* Rate Changes \r\n\u2022 If FWCU advertised mortgage rates below the rate guarantee at the time of funding, the member/customer will benefit from the new lower rate at the time of funding. This does not mean the lowest rate during the entire guarantee period, e.g. low water mark (Applies: British Columbia)",
