        "description": "* The member may repay up to 20% of the original Principal Amount in aggregate during each 12-month period (from date of advance or date of last renewal) when not in default, without prior notice and without payment of any compensation. If the member fail to exercise this privilege in any year, it will lapse and may not make it up in any subsequent years; and\r\n* The member may increase regular monthly payments by an amount up to and including 20% of the scheduled payment amount, once per 12 month period excluding first year of disbursement (Applies: British Columbia)",
        "isAccepted": null
