        "id": 76,
        "policy": "Property Type",
        "description": "**Approved Property Types**\r\n- Owner-Occupied Residences (e.g., single family, townhomes, condos)\r\n- Second Homes (Type A) - 4-season, winterized, insured\r\n- Rental Properties (max 4 incl. principal residence)\r\n- Condos (Strata Units) - Minimum 600 sq ft or must be insured\r\n- Hobby Farms / ALR Land - Up to 20 acres; no farming income or outbuildings included in value\r\n- Micro Suites / Bachelor Units - If insured\r\n- Manufactured Homes - De-registered, affixed to foundation, on owned land\r\n- Leased Land - With BDM approval\r\n- Remediated Grow Ops / Meth Labs - With full documentation and program conditions\r\n- Bare Land Condos - Considered with BDM review\r\n- Strata Properties - With Form B, fire insurance, and minimum size compliance\r\n- Water Potability Certificate/Test and Septic inspection may be needed \r\n**Not Approved Property Types**\r\n- 3-Season Cottages / Cabins - Not accepted\r\n- Commercial or Agricultural Use Properties - Not accepted\r\n- Vacant Land / Raw Land - Not financeable on its own\r\n- Spec Builds - Not eligible for construction financing\r\n- Properties in Business Names - Not allowed\r\n- Self-Build Construction - Not allowed\r\n- Uninsurable Properties - If not meeting insurer guidelines\r\n- Shared/Co-op Ownership - Not accepted\r\n- Non-Permanent Dwellings - Trailers, tiny homes, mobile homes not affixed. (Applies: British Columbia)",
