        "description": "**Documentation Required**\r\n* Rental Property (Subject) Lease OR Appraisal with FMR, NOA, T1, Property Tax, Heat, Condo Fees\r\n* Multiple Rentals (Non-subject) Lease(s), T1 + T776, NOA, DSC Worksheet\r\n* No Lease (New Rental) Appraisal with FMR note, subject to 65% LTV cap\r\n* Insured Mortgage (CMHC/Sagen/CG) Follow insurer-specific rental documentation rules (Applies: British Columbia)",
