        "description": "* Ontario only\r\n* We are now lending from Sault Ste Marie, Sudbury and North Bay all the way down with all parts in between to Windsor. Previously, we would look at these areas but, we wouldn\u2019t do any prime rates when home was more than 45min drive to our nearest branch. Anything over 45 min was given Alt A rates and 1% lender fee regardless of how good the deal was and we couldn\u2019t do High Ratio deals. Now we are able to look at the deals regales of the area and adjudicate the deal as it should, on its merits and give the best rate it deserves (Applies: Ontario)",
