        "description": "* We do not use a rental worksheet\r\n* We use rental income as \u201cother income,\u201d 50 to 80% using lease and T1s, and we don\u2019t include taxes and heat on non-subject rentals.\r\n* A straight switch from other financial institutions is permitted as long as the lender is on our list.\r\n* A property once owner-occupied and is currently insured and then became a rental cannot be switched to FirstOntario Credit union as an insured mortgage.\r\n* We go to 3 units or doors as rentals unless they don\u2019t have an owner-occupied home, then we can do a fourplex or four doors. Remember our max doors are 4, 1 o/o and up to 3 as rentals as a total for the clients, not just with us.\r\n* All rental refi\u2019s and purchases are uninsurable (Applies: Ontario)",
