        "description": "Property Types\r\nEligible Property Types\r\nOwner-occupied residences or properties being purchased for owner occupancy, held in single or joint tenancy.\r\nA Traditional, B Non-Traditional and Alt-A: value of the house plus up to 10 acres, with no outbuildings.\r\nSingle-family dwellings.\r\nMulti-family dwellings with a maximum of 4 fully self-contained units.\r\nRegistered condominium units.\r\nStone foundations may be considered where common for the area, subject to enhanced due diligence.\r\nIneligible Property Types\r\nGrow operations/drug labs, including remediated properties.\r\nInsulbrick construction.\r\nJohn Mansville siding.\r\nKITEC plumbing.\r\nProperties with restricted covenants.\r\nRooming/boarding houses, B&Bs and Airbnbs.\r\nShouses (personal workshop/storage connected to a house).\r\nFloating homes/houseboats.\r\nContainer homes.\r\nCo-operatives.\r\nGovernment or privately sponsored social housing.\r\nWorking farms.\r\nUnique properties, such as former schools or churches.\r\nProperties without year-round access and all services.\r\nIndustrial/commercial properties.\r\nTimeshares. (Applies: Ontario)",
