        "description": "* Alberta\r\n* Atlantic Provinces (only Metropolitan areas with populations exceeding 10,000)\r\n* British Columbia\r\n* Ontario\r\n* Manitoba \r\n* Quebec\r\n* Saskatchewan (Applies: National)",
        "isAccepted": null
