        "policy": "Beacon/FICO Scores",
        "description": "**High Ratio:**\r\n* Primary Borrower - minimum 680. \r\n* Co-Borrower - minimum 650.\r\n**Conventional:**\r\n* Primary Residence: \r\n o Primary Borrower - minimum 650.\r\n o Co-Borrower - minimum 620.\r\n* Secondary Home and Investment Property:\r\n o Primary Borrower - minimum 680.\r\n o Co-Borrower - minimum 650.\r\n**Near Prime**\r\n* Minimum Beacon 500 (Applies: National)",
