        "description": "**Prime**\r\n* Beacon <680: max GDS/TDS = 35%/42%\r\n* Beacon \u2265 680: max GDS/TDS = 39%/44%\r\n**Near Prime**\r\n* 55/55 Max if Beacon above 620\r\n* 46/48 Max if below 620 (Applies: National)",
        "isAccepted": null
