        "description": "* Gifted funds allowed and must be from an immediate family member. An immediate family member is defined as a spouse, parent, child, brother, sister, grandparent, or guardian.\r\n* Note: Gifted down payment is permitted for the Business for Self (ALT. A) / Self-Employed (Low Doc) program as long as a minimum of 5% is from the borrower\u2019s own saved resources.\" (Applies: National)",
