        "policy": "Rentals - Amortization, LTV, Debt Servicing & Gifted Down Payment",
        "description": "**Amortization:**\r\n* Up to 25 years.\r\n**LTV:**\r\n* Maximum 80% LTV; subject to a Mortgage Insurance premium: \r\n* Loans 65% LTV are Transactional (Borrower paid) \r\n**Debt Servicing:**\r\n* GDS/TDS 39%/44%\r\n**Down Payment:**\r\n* Down-payment must be from own resources. Gifted funds are not permitted.\" (Applies: National)",
