        "policy": "Rentals - Area, Maximum Doors & Net Worth Requirements",
        "description": "**Lending Area - loans may be originated in following provinces:**\r\n* Alberta\r\n* Atlantic Provinces (only Metropolitan areas with populations exceeding 10,000)\r\n* British Columbia\r\n* Ontario\r\n* Manitoba\r\n* Quebec (Approved partners only)\r\n* Saskatchewan\r\n**Max Doors:**\r\n* 2-4 units - marketable residential dwelling with municipal zoning, fully self-contained units.\" (Applies: National)",
