        "policy": "Income - Salaried, Hourly, Contract, Part-Time, Bonus or Casual",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] * Regular Full Time or Part time\r\n* Use Both a primary & secondary method\r\n* Primary Method\r\n* Obtain one of the following\r\n* Recent Pay Stub\r\n* Two months of recent direct deposit history\r\n* Current Letter of Employment , If a letter of employment and another additional documentation from a primary method is obtained verification using a secondary method is not required\r\n* Secondary Method\r\n* Obtain one of the following\r\n* Previous year end paystub\r\n* Most recent T4\r\n* Most recent NOA\r\n* Please note for uninsurable applications one secondary method is verbal verification with the employer.\r\n* For applicants who work for family and/or are considered employed at non-arm\u2019s-length, additional verification may be required.\r\n* For Casual, Secondary Job, Contract, Overtime, Bonuses, Tips\r\n* Primary Method\r\n* Obtain one of the following\r\n* Current Pay Stub\r\n* Current Letter of Employment\r\n* Secondary Method\r\n* Obtain two of the following to verify income for the past two years\r\n* Previous year end pay stub\r\n* NOA\r\n* T4\r\n* Please note for uninsurable applications one secondary method is verbal verification with the employer (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, Saskatchewan)",
