        "policy": "Submission Tips & Underwriting Assistance",
        "description": "**Send us a message**\r\nContact your account officer or E-mail your inquiry/Application to mortgages@ctbcbank.ca & we\u2019ll work together to see if your deal is a fit\r\n**Collaborate with your account officer**\r\nWe want to help. The A/O will listen, assess and collaborate with you to find the best options for your clients needs. When youre ready we\u2019ll prepare the term sheet for your client to take the next step\r\n**Work Together with the Account officer**\r\nOnce a term sheet is accepted, the mortgage officers will work together with you and provide ongoing support to complete the conditions to get the\r\nfile to the finish line & close on time. (Applies: British Columbia, Ontario)",
