        "id": 47,
        "policy": "Debt Servicing",
        "description": "**HELOC:**\r\n* New HELOC: payment is based on the limit amortized over 25 years at the greater of the contract rate and OSFI floor rate\r\n* Existing HELOC: payment is based on the current balance amortized over 25 years at the greater of the contract rate and OSFI floor rate\r\n**Debt Servicing Ratios and Calculations**\r\n* Maximum GDS/TDS Ratios\r\n* 39% / 44% for Beacon scores 680+\r\n* 35% / 42% for Beacon scores 620\u2013679\r\n* Gross Debt Service (GDS) Ratio Formula\r\n* Annual Housing Costs\r\n* (Principal + Interest + Taxes + Heat + 50% of Condo Fees/Strata Fees)\r\n\u00f7\r\n* Gross Annual Income\r\n* Total Debt Service (TDS) Ratio Formula\r\n* Annual Housing Costs + Other Debt Obligations\r\n\u00f7\r\n* Gross Annual Income\r\n* Where the borrower is not a homeowner, annual housing costs are based on rent. (Applies: British Columbia)",
