        "id": 81,
        "policy": "Rentals - Amortization, LTV, Debt Servicing & Gifted Down Payment",
        "description": "**Amortization**\r\n* 25 years insured / 30 year uninsured \r\n**Notes**\r\n* Non-Owner Occupied Rental Property: \r\n* For borrowers with a strong personal covenant, Prospera Credit Union will now consider applications up to 80% loan to value\r\n**Rental / Investment Property**\r\n* 80% on first $1.5 million, 50% of balance\r\n**Leasehold Rental**\r\n* 75% on first $1 million, 50% on the balance\r\n* First Nations up to 80% on first $1 million, 50% on the balance\r\n**Leasehold Owner Occupied**\r\n* 75% on first $1 million, 50% on the balance\r\n* First Nations: 80% on the first $1 million and 50% on the balance\r\n***Debt Servicing:***\r\n**Rental Income**\r\n- < 50% gross income from rentals is permitted\r\n- Owner Occupied with suite(s): 100% add-back (maximum two suites)\r\n- Rental Property: 85% rental offset (less taxes, heat and strata)\r\n**Note**\r\n* Currently new members are only allowed insured rentals (Applies: British Columbia)",
        "isAccepted": null
