        "description": "* Rental Income (< 50% gross income from rentals is permitted)\r\n* Rental Property: 85% rental offset (less taxes, heat and strata)\r\n**Owner Occupied Property with Suite Income:**\r\n* Prospera Credit Union will now accept income for up to two suites in an owner occupied home\r\n* 100% of the gross rental income is acceptable to be added to the gross employment income\r\n* Where income from two rental suites is added to income, property taxes and heat will be included in the debt service calculation\r\n* Where income from only one rental suite is added to income, property taxes and heat will be excluded from debt service. (Applies: British Columbia)",
