        "policy": "Equity & Net Worth Lending",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **High Equity Program (ie Ratios up to 60%/60% when 65% LTV or less)**\r\n* Available on O/O or 2nd homes only (no rentals).\r\n* Credit must be 600+ for all applicants and no derog in the last 24 months.\r\n* 65% Max.\r\n* No rate premium.\r\n**High Net Worth Program:**\r\n* Available on O/O or 2nd homes only (no rentals).\r\n* Credit must be 680+ for all applicants and no derog in the last 24 months.\r\n* Max 75% on Purchases and Refi's.\r\n* Ratios must be under 75% without assets.\r\n* Take the verified liquid assets (no gifts allowed) and divide by 5 to give an annual payment (over 5 years). Add this payment to income. GDS/TDS must now be under 50%/50%\r\n* Verified liquid assets in non-registered accounts or non-locked-in registered savings plans held by a Canadian Financial Institution with a minimum 90-day deposit history. We can now accept RRSP's with a 30% penalty calculation.\r\n* 50Bps rate premium. (Applies: Alberta, British Columbia, New Brunswick, Newfoundland & Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island)",
        "isAccepted": null
