        "description": "[ACCEPTED] * Co-applicants (residing and non-residing), guarantors, and spouses may be used for qualification purposes.\r\n* Non-residing co-borrowers and guarantors must be an immediate family member (father, mother, child, brother, sister, grandparent, legal guardian, or legal dependent)\r\n* All applicant debts must be included in the TDSR calculation\r\n* All applicants must meet all applicable product requirements\r\n* The mortgage(s) will be reported to the credit bureau.\r\n* Note: \r\n* Spouses not included on the purchase or mortgage application will be required to obtain Independent Legal Advice (ILA)\" (Applies: Alberta, Ontario)",
        "isAccepted": null
