        "description": "[ACCEPTED] * Eligble LTV: 90.1% - 95%\r\n* Eligible equity sources include: Personal loans, lines of credit, credit cards, gifts from sources other than non-immediate family members.\r\n* Repayment of borrowed funds must be included in the TDS calculation. These funds may be borrowed provided any associated repayments are included in the TDS calculation based on a 12-month repayment period. \r\n* Lender to ensure that the borrower has the resources to accomodate all closing costs for the mortgage transaction.\r\n* Note: Please reference our Debt Servicing guidelines. We align with Sagen's Borrowed Down Payment program. More information available on Sagen's website.\" (Applies: Alberta, Ontario)",
