        "policy": "Income - Assured Income for the Severely Handicapped (AISH)",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] For disability income to be used, it must be proven as current and long-lasting. For Disability Income Verification:\r\n**Primary Source**\r\nObtain the following: \r\n1. Letter from the organization providing the pension/disability confirming income & duration.\r\n2. 3-month bank statements.\r\n**Secondary Source**\r\nObtain 1 of the following: If a letter is not available\r\n1. Notice of Assessment (NOA) for past with T1 Generals.\r\n2. T5007 \u2013 Statement of Benefits. (Applies: Alberta, Ontario)",
        "isAccepted": null
