        "policy": "Rentals - General Information",
        "description": "[ACCEPTED] **Rentals | Conventional Purchase/Refinance (Uninsured)**\r\n**Loan Purpose:** Help Investors purchase real estate to diversify their investment portfolio and general rental income. Purchase can be made in individual name or Holdco. Holdco Purchases are subject to rate premiums.\r\n**Term:** Fixed Rate 1-5 years, Variable Rate 5 year. \r\n**Maximum Loan Amount:**\r\n* 80% LTV \u2013 1-2 Units purchase \r\n* 75% LTV \u2013 1-2 Units refinance\r\n* 65% LTV \u2013 3-4 Units purchase/refinance\r\n**Amortization:** Minimum 10 years, Maximum 30 years.\r\n**Qualifying Rate:** The qualifying interest rate is the greater of the contract rate plus 2% or 5.25%.\r\n**Maximum Doors:** Borrower may have a maximum of 6 doors including owner occupied home and home being purchased. Example-Client Owns a Primary residence with a suite (2 doors), a duplex (2 doors), and is looking to purchase another rental with a suite (2 doors), we will consider the file as it is within our 6 door limit.\r\n**Rental Income:** \r\n- Owner Occupied In-unit suite: 100% add back to income based on market rent.\r\n- Subject/Non-Subject, 1-4 unit: Add 100% of the rental income to the gross income, less vacancy rate, maintenance rate, PITH & 50% condo fees (if applicable). Heat can be removed if we can verify the tenant is paying heat - verify using lease agreement. Please refer to our rental worksheet.\r\n**Borrower Documents:**\r\nIn addition to standard application docs we may require but are not limited to: \r\n- Market rent appraisals required on all new rental purchases.\r\n- Current Tenancy Agreements with 2 years T1\u2019s showing rent is consistent.\r\n- Property Title search for each non-subject property.\r\n- Current Bank statements. (Applies: Alberta, Ontario)",
