        "policy": "Down Payment",
        "description": "* 3 months of most recent statements must be provided showing client name and account number ( Savings/TFSA's/RRSP's/Bonds/Stocks etc. ) Funds must be present in bank account.\r\n* Source of large deposits must be verified.\r\n* Funds are required to be from own resources and without being borrowed.\r\n* Verification that funds are on deposit is also required prior to funding.\r\n* Closing costs of 1.5% of purchase price must be verified for high ratio files.\r\n* Proceeds from sale of existing property being used for down payment requires the firm and unconditional sale agreement, recent mortgage statements, property tax bill are required. NOTE real estate commissions, solicitor fees and other costs to be considered for calculation of net proceeds\" (Applies: Ontario)",
