        "description": "* Refinances can go through a lawyer or FCT.\r\n* Appraisal will be required and fee is paid directly to Brookfield or NAS.\r\n* For ALL Refinances the Payout Penalty and Maturity date must be included with application\r\n* Existing Alterna Clients\r\n* Blends and Extends are possible for existing Alterna Clients, brokers get paid on new funds advanced.\r\n* Equity Takeouts\r\n* For equity take outs please provide: clear and detailed notes about use of funds, quotes for renovations, contracts etc (Applies: Ontario)",
